<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#eeeee7"><meta name="description" content="以公开高程和人口栅格描绘山川与人海。支持行政区划、GeoJSON 边界、剖面线地图和高清导出。"><title>山川人海 · Ridge Atlas</title><style>:root{--paper:#f8f8f2;--bg:#eeeee7;--text:#283c35;--muted:#859087;--border:#dcded4;--olive:#89936e;--plum:#704b65;--accent:#e07563}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:"Noto Sans SC","Source Han Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:13px}button,input,select{font:inherit}button,a,input,select{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}button{cursor:pointer;color:inherit}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:wait}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #e07563;outline-offset:3px}button{border:1px solid var(--border);background:transparent;border-radius:5px}button:hover{background:#e6e8df}a{color:inherit}header{height:80px;background:#f5f5ef;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 32px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:80px}.brand{text-decoration:none;display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;font:600 21px "Source Han Serif SC","Noto Serif SC",serif;letter-spacing:3px}.brand small{display:block;font:9px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:3.1px;margin-top:6px}.brand svg{color:#596c5d}nav{height:100%;display:flex;gap:30px}.nav{border:0;border-radius:0;position:relative;font-size:13px;padding:0 4px;color:#819086}.nav.active{color:var(--text)}.nav.active:after{content:"";height:2px;background:var(--text);position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0}.nav span{margin-left:10px}.header-right{margin-left:auto;color:#6c7d70;font-size:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.live-dot{width:6px;height:6px;background:#879870;border-radius:50%}.version{margin-left:20px;font:10px monospace;color:#98a196}main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:304px 1fr;min-height:calc(100vh - 80px)}.controls{padding:30px 25px;border-right:1px solid var(--border);background:#f4f4ee}.eyebrow{font:9px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8b9689}.panel-intro h1{font:500 22px "Source Han Serif SC","Noto Serif SC",serif;margin:14px 0 9px;letter-spacing:1px}.panel-intro p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:29px}section{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:23px 0}h2{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 19px}section h2>span{font:11px monospace;color:#99a08e;margin-right:9px}label{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#727e70;margin:14px 0 8px}select,input[type=text]{background:#fafaf5;border:1px solid #d9ded3;width:100%;height:37px;padding:0 11px;border-radius:4px;color:var(--text);font-size:12px}select{cursor:pointer}.segmented{display:flex;background:#e9ece3;border-radius:5px;padding:3px}.segmented button{flex:1;border:0;font-size:12px;padding:8px;color:#8c958a}.segmented .active{background:#fdfdf7;color:var(--text);box-shadow:0 1px 4px #2b403315}.scope-note{font-size:10px;margin-top:11px;color:#7d8977;line-height:1.7}.layer-card{border:1px solid #d7dccd;display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center;padding:12px 10px;margin:9px 0;background:#fafaf5;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;position:relative}.layer-card:has(input:checked){border-color:#a3ad91}.layer-card input{position:absolute;opacity:0;left:10px}.layer-card:has(input:focus-visible){outline:2px solid #e07563}.layer-symbol{width:29px;height:29px;font-size:27px;line-height:26px}.olive{color:var(--olive)}.plum{color:var(--plum)}.layer-card b{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#455542}.layer-card small{font-size:9px;display:block;color:#98a08f;margin-top:6px}.checkmark{width:14px;height:14px;border:1px solid #b6bfac;border-radius:3px;margin-left:auto}.layer-card input:checked~.checkmark{background:#4e6351;border-color:#4e6351}.layer-card input:checked~.checkmark:after{content:'✓';display:block;color:#fff;text-align:center;line-height:12px;font-size:10px}.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.primary{background:#344f40;color:#fff;border:0;padding:13px 17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.primary:hover{background:#47644d}#generate{width:100%;margin-top:18px;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:12px}.hint{font-size:10px;color:#899380;line-height:1.8;margin:11px 0 0}.range-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:17px}.range-label output{font:11px monospace;color:#53694f}input[type=range]{width:100%;height:3px;accent-color:#657951;cursor:pointer;margin:8px 0 6px}.palettes{display:flex;gap:10px}.palettes button{padding:4px;display:flex;border-radius:30px;border:1px solid transparent}.palettes button.active{border-color:#879677}.palettes i{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;margin:-1px}.toggle-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px}.toggle-row label{margin:8px 0;font-size:11px}input[type=checkbox]{accent-color:#526a4b}.text-btn{border:0;font-size:10px;color:#7c8d77;padding:3px}.aside-foot{font-size:10px;color:#9aa491;line-height:1.8;padding-top:17px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.aside-foot span{font:8px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1px}.studio{min-width:0;padding:31px 34px 18px}.studio-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.studio-toolbar h2{font:500 24px "Source Han Serif SC","Noto Serif SC",serif;margin:10px 0 21px;letter-spacing:2px}.studio-toolbar h2 span{font:10px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#9ca594;margin-left:15px}.toolbar-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}.icon-btn{border:0;color:#8a9781;font-size:19px}.icon-btn span{font-size:10px;margin-left:5px}.export-btn{background:#f8f8f0;padding:10px 17px;font-size:11px}.export-btn span{margin-left:17px}.viewbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin:5px 0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);height:37px}.view-tabs{display:flex;gap:23px;height:100%}.view-tabs button{border:0;border-radius:0;font-size:11px;color:#92a08a;padding:0 0 13px;position:relative}.view-tabs button.active{color:#384e3c}.view-tabs button.active:after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:2px;background:#6a7f58}.canvas-meta{font:9px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#9ba58f;padding-bottom:12px}.canvas-wrap{background:#e5e7dc;background-image:radial-gradient(#b5bda555 .7px,transparent .7px);background-size:8px 8px;padding:26px 26px 18px;border:1px solid #dce0d3;min-height:440px;position:relative}.paper{box-shadow:0 5px 25px #243d2810;max-width:1120px;margin:auto;background:#f9f9f3;overflow:hidden}.paper>svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.initial-loading{padding:170px 0;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#87957d}.canvas-caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;color:#8d9a7f;margin:16px 0 0}.canvas-caption>span:last-child{font:8px Arial;letter-spacing:1.7px}.legend-line{display:inline-block;width:17px;height:1px;background:#81956e;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px}.statusbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 0 19px;font-size:10px;color:#89947d;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:12px}.statusbar #status{max-width:80%;line-height:1.7}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;padding:24px 0;gap:14px}.metrics>div{border-right:1px solid var(--border);padding-left:10px}.metrics>div:first-child{padding-left:0}.metrics>div:last-child{border:0}.metrics small{font-size:10px;color:#929d85;display:block;margin-bottom:9px}.metrics b{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#596c4f}.studio-note{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:17px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;color:#929f88;letter-spacing:1px}.studio-note>span:last-child{font:8px Arial}.upload-box{text-align:center;border:1px dashed #acb69f;padding:22px 9px;cursor:pointer;position:relative;border-radius:5px}.upload-box>span{font-size:24px;display:block}.upload-box strong{display:block;margin:8px 0;font-size:12px}.upload-box small{font-size:9px}.upload-box input{width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}.progress{height:3px;background:#dce2d3;margin-top:14px}.progress i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:#7b9365;transition:width .3s}#progressText{font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;color:#738266;margin-bottom:4px}dialog{width:min(760px,94vw);max-height:86vh;overflow:auto;background:#f7f7f0;border:1px solid #cbd2bf;border-radius:9px;padding:35px;color:var(--text);box-shadow:0 20px 100px #273c3433}dialog::backdrop{background:#1a312c66;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}dialog h2{font:500 25px "Source Han Serif SC",serif;margin:18px 0}dialog h3{font-size:14px}dialog p{font-size:12px;color:#74816c;line-height:1.9}.dialog-close{float:right;border:0;font-size:25px;line-height:18px}.source-list article{padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.source-list b{font:10px monospace;color:#8b9a7c}.source-list a{font-size:11px;margin-right:15px}.notice{background:#e9ecdf;padding:14px}.export-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:20px 0}.export-grid button{padding:15px;text-align:left}.import-project{padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);line-height:2.7}.import-project input{font-size:11px;margin-left:10px}#toast{position:fixed;bottom:28px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#2e493b;color:#fff;padding:14px 23px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 5px 25px #22372c33;z-index:100;font-size:12px;max-width:90vw;line-height:1.7}[hidden]{display:none!important}
@media(min-width:1500px){main{grid-template-columns:326px 1fr}.controls{padding:35px 30px}.studio{padding:35px 50px}}@media(max-width:1100px){header{gap:30px;padding:0 20px}.header-right{font-size:0}.version{font-size:9px}.studio{padding:24px 20px}main{grid-template-columns:278px 1fr}.controls{padding:24px 18px}.canvas-wrap{padding:15px}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.metrics>div{margin-bottom:5px}.metrics>div:nth-child(2){border:0}.canvas-meta{display:none}}@media(max-width:760px){header{height:66px;gap:18px;padding:0 16px}.brand{font-size:17px;gap:8px;letter-spacing:1px}.brand svg{width:28px}.brand small{font-size:7px}.header-right{display:none}nav{margin-left:auto;gap:13px}.nav{font-size:11px}main{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.controls{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;padding:24px 20px}.panel-intro{grid-column:1/-1}.panel-intro p{margin-bottom:0}section{padding:18px 0}.styling{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5px 20px}.styling h2{grid-column:1/-1}.styling>label,.styling>input{grid-column:1/-1}.aside-foot{display:none}.studio{padding:22px 14px}.canvas-wrap{padding:10px;min-height:0}.studio-toolbar h2{font-size:20px}.icon-btn{display:none}.view-tabs{gap:20px}.canvas-caption>span:last-child{display:none}.metrics{padding:18px 0}.metrics b{font-size:12px}.statusbar{gap:8px}dialog{padding:25px}.studio-note{font-size:8px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}

.download-local{display:block;font-size:12px;margin:18px 0;color:#596f4a;text-underline-offset:4px}

.task-notice{background:#eef1e5;border:1px solid #c8d3bd;color:#526849;padding:12px 16px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.task-notice[data-kind=error]{background:#fff1e9;border-color:#e3b29f;color:#8c4937}.task-notice[data-kind=success]{background:#edf1e5}.paper[aria-busy=true]{opacity:.5}#generate:disabled{cursor:progress}
</style></head><body>
<header><a class="brand" href="./"><svg width="37" height="37" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><path d="M3 29L14 10L22 25L29 16L37 29M3 34L14 15L22 30L29 21L37 34M3 24L14 5L22 20L29 11L37 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg><span>山川人海<small>RIDGE ATLAS</small></span></a><nav><button class="nav active" id="workspaceTab">制图工作台</button><button class="nav" id="aboutButton">数据与方法 <span>↗</span></button></nav><div class="header-right"><span class="live-dot"></span> 开放数据 · 本地绘制 <span class="version">V 1.1</span></div></header>
<main><aside class="controls"><div class="panel-intro"><span class="eyebrow">MAP COMPOSER</span><h1>让数据，成为地景。</h1><p>在横向线条之间，读懂山川与人海。</p></div>
<section><h2><span>01</span> 选择制图范围</h2><div class="segmented"><button class="active" id="presetTab">行政区划</button><button id="uploadTab">上传边界</button></div><div id="presetPane"><label for="country">国家 / 区域</label><select id="country"><option value="CHN">中国 · 含台湾、香港、澳门</option></select><div id="chinaControls"><label for="province">省级行政区</label><select id="province"><option value="all">全国</option></select><div id="cityWrap" hidden><label for="city">市级 / 区县</label><select id="city"><option value="all">全省 / 全区域</option></select></div></div><div class="scope-note" id="scopeNote">全国图含南海诸岛及台港澳局部图</div></div><div id="uploadPane" hidden><label for="boundaryFile" class="upload-box"><span>↥</span><strong>选择 GeoJSON 边界</strong><small>Polygon / MultiPolygon · 最大 12 MB</small><input id="boundaryFile" type="file" accept=".geojson,.json,application/geo+json,application/json"></label><label for="uploadCrs">上传坐标系</label><select id="uploadCrs"><option value="wgs">WGS84 / EPSG:4326</option><option value="gcj">GCJ-02 · 转为 WGS84</option></select><p class="hint" id="uploadNote">支持多面与孔洞。文件在浏览器内处理。</p></div></section>
<section><h2><span>02</span> 选择数据图层</h2><label class="layer-card"><input type="checkbox" id="elevation" checked><span class="layer-symbol olive">≋</span><span><b>高程地形</b><small>Terrain Tiles · 高程 / m</small></span><span class="checkmark"></span></label><label class="layer-card"><input type="checkbox" id="population" checked><span class="layer-symbol plum">▥</span><span><b>人口分布</b><small>WorldPop · 密度 / 人/km²</small></span><span class="checkmark"></span></label><div class="two-col"><div><label for="year">人口年份</label><select id="year"></select></div><div><label for="resolution">源分辨率</label><select id="resolution"><option value="1km">1 km · 区域</option><option value="100m">100 m · 城市</option></select></div></div><label for="dataMode">数据读取方式</label><select id="dataMode"><option value="auto">优先内置数据 · 稳定快速</option><option value="online">实时读取 · 需要联网</option></select><button class="primary" id="generate"><span>生成地图</span><span>↗</span></button><div id="progressBox" hidden><div class="progress"><i id="progressBar"></i></div><p id="progressText" role="status"></p><button class="text-btn" id="cancel">取消读取</button></div><p class="hint" id="dataHint">全部预设国家及中国省级区域已内置 2020 年 / 1 km 数据快照。</p></section>
<section class="styling"><h2><span>03</span> 调整视觉</h2><label class="range-label" for="lines">剖面线密度 <output id="linesValue">150</output></label><input id="lines" type="range" min="60" max="280" value="150" step="10"><label class="range-label" for="height">地形起伏 <output id="heightValue">85</output></label><input id="height" type="range" min="10" max="160" value="85"><label class="range-label" for="popHeight">人口峰值 <output id="popHeightValue">75</output></label><input id="popHeight" type="range" min="10" max="200" value="75"><div class="two-col"><div><label for="curve">人口缩放</label><select id="curve"><option value="sqrt">平方根</option><option value="log">对数</option><option value="linear">线性</option></select></div><div><label for="lineWidth">线条粗细</label><select id="lineWidth"><option value="0.65">纤细</option><option value="1" selected>标准</option><option value="1.5">加粗</option></select></div></div><label>配色方案</label><div class="palettes" role="group" aria-label="配色方案"><button data-palette="atlas" class="active" title="苔原与葡萄" aria-label="苔原与葡萄"><i style="background:#89936e"></i><i style="background:#704b65"></i></button><button data-palette="clay" title="赤陶与青黛" aria-label="赤陶与青黛"><i style="background:#c28365"></i><i style="background:#456771"></i></button><button data-palette="ink" title="水墨" aria-label="水墨"><i style="background:#8b9693"></i><i style="background:#293f46"></i></button><button data-palette="night" title="夜色" aria-label="夜色"><i style="background:#b9c7a0"></i><i style="background:#e1a0b9"></i></button></div><label for="mapTitle">作品标题</label><input id="mapTitle" type="text" maxlength="55" value="山川与人海"><div class="toggle-row"><label><input type="checkbox" id="labels" checked> 标题与图例</label><button id="reset" class="text-btn">重置样式</button></div></section><div class="aside-foot">绘制真实数据，保留每一处差异。<br><span>DESIGNED FOR THE CURIOUS.</span></div></aside>
<div class="studio"><div class="studio-toolbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CARTOGRAPHIC CANVAS</span><h2 id="regionHeading">中国 <span>CHINA</span></h2></div><div class="toolbar-actions"><button class="icon-btn" id="fit" title="适合画布">⊡ <span>适合画布</span></button><button class="export-btn" id="exportOpen">导出作品 <span>↓</span></button></div></div><div class="viewbar"><div class="view-tabs"><button data-view="overlay" class="active">叠加图</button><button data-view="elevation">高程图</button><button data-view="population">人口图</button><button data-view="triptych">三联画</button></div><span class="canvas-meta" id="canvasMeta">横向剖面 · 2020</span></div><div class="canvas-wrap" id="canvasWrap"><div id="taskNotice" class="task-notice" role="status" hidden></div><div class="paper" id="artwork" aria-label="地图作品预览"><div class="initial-loading">正在装载公开数据快照…</div></div><div class="canvas-caption"><span><i class="legend-line"></i> 地形的起伏，与人群的聚落。</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span></div></div><div class="statusbar"><span id="status" role="status">准备制图数据</span><button class="text-btn" id="metadataOpen">查看数据说明 ↗</button></div><div class="metrics"><div><small>数据范围</small><b id="scopeMetric">—</b></div><div><small>高程主体范围 · P1–P99</small><b id="heightMetric">—</b></div><div><small>人口密度峰值</small><b id="popMetric">—</b></div><div><small>有效覆盖 / 高程 · 人口</small><b id="coverageMetric">—</b></div></div><div class="studio-note"><span>01 — 山川有起伏，人海有聚散。</span><span>云金 × OPENAI</span></div></div></main>
<dialog id="infoDialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="关闭">×</button><span class="eyebrow">DATA & METHODOLOGY</span><h2>数据有来处，图形有尺度。</h2><div id="activeMetadata"></div><div class="source-list"><article><b>01 / 高程</b><h3>Mapzen Terrain Tiles</h3><p>公开全球地形瓦片，Terrarium RGB 解码为米。不同地区原始数据与年代不同；屏幕采样分辨率随范围变化，不代表原始测量精度。</p><a href="https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">数据与使用条款 ↗</a></article><article><b>02 / 人口</b><h3>WorldPop · 2000—2020</h3><p>采用 Esri 托管的 WorldPop 年度人口密度栅格，单位为人/km²，提供约 1 km 与 100 m 两种产品。是模型估计，不是实时人口；100 m 产品不会增加已有数据的真实性。CC BY 4.0，保留来源署名。</p><a href="https://worldpop.arcgis.com/arcgis/rest/services/WorldPop_Population_Density_1km/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看人口服务 ↗</a></article><article><b>03 / 边界</b><h3>DataV GeoAtlas / Natural Earth</h3><p>中国内置 34 个省级行政区，包含台湾、香港和澳门，保留南海诸岛图示。DataV 边界从 GCJ-02 作近似逆转换；其他预设使用 Natural Earth 概化边界。支持导入自己的 WGS84 GeoJSON。</p><a href="https://datav.aliyun.com/portal/school/atlas/area_selector" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GeoAtlas ↗</a> <a href="https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Natural Earth · 公共领域 ↗</a></article></div><h3>内置数据与实时读取</h3><p>默认使用全部预设国家和中国 34 个省级行政区的真实 2020 年 / 1 km 快照。其他年份与 100 m 产品需联网；在线服务超时会明确提示。内置快照的画布采样网格随范围变化，裁剪小区域不会增加源数据细节。</p><h3>如何读图</h3><p>每条线是一条固定纬度剖面，并非等高线。主图采用局部标准纬线的等距圆柱表达。高程、人口分别使用独立的视觉高度；叠加表示共址分布，不将两种不同单位相加。人口默认平方根缩放，以区域有效采样的第 99.7 百分位作视觉截断，完整原值保留在 CSV 中。放大图按各自范围独立归一化，峰高不可直接跨图比较。</p><p>缺测值形成断线，不作为零值填补。高程统计展示 P1—P99 主体范围；公开高程瓦片可能存在孤立异常值，绘图上限使用 P99.5，负高程绘制在基线。全国图中的港澳区域使用局部放大图；南海诸岛为边界定位附图，不参与主图数值拉伸。自定义全国边界会校验台港澳覆盖，若不完整将阻止以“中国”命名导出。</p><p class="notice">本工具输出数据艺术图，不替代标准地图或统计分析。印刷与公开发布前，请核验边界来源、地图规范和署名要求。</p></dialog>
<dialog id="exportDialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="关闭">×</button><span class="eyebrow">TAKE YOUR MAP WITH YOU</span><h2>把这幅地景带走。</h2><p>图片保留当前图层、配色、标题与数据署名。</p><label for="exportSize">PNG 输出长边</label><select id="exportSize"><option value="2400">2400 px · 日常分享</option><option value="4000" selected>4000 px · 高清海报</option><option value="6000">6000 px · 大幅打印</option></select><div class="export-grid"><button id="savePng" class="primary">下载 PNG ↓</button><button id="saveSvg">下载矢量 SVG ↓</button><button id="saveCsv">下载采样 CSV ↓</button><button id="saveProject">保存制图项目 ↓</button></div><a id="downloadLocal" class="download-local" href="" download="山川人海_本地工作台.html">下载本地单文件 HTML ↓</a><label class="import-project">恢复项目文件 <input type="file" id="projectFile" accept=".json"></label><p class="hint">项目包含边界、已读取栅格和样式，可在断网后恢复。CSV 是采样值，不是完整原始栅格。</p></dialog>
